<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
    <!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
        <link rel="icon" href="/uploads/image/20260320/8288c3b00b2317048181829125d56bd4.png" />
        <meta name="renderer" content="webkit">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,user-scalable=no,maximum-scale=1.0">
    <title>许搜 - 全网影视资源 - 网盘资源搜索神器</title>
    <meta name="keywords" content="许搜,网盘搜索,百度网盘搜索,百度云搜索,夸克网盘搜索,迅雷网盘搜索" />
    <meta name="description" content="支持百度网盘，夸克网盘，阿里云盘，UC网盘，迅雷云盘等搜索服务，是您工作、学习、娱乐的网盘搜索神器。" />
    <meta name="referrer" content="no-referrer">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/views/index/news/common/static/css/index.min.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/views/index/news/common/static/css/app.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/views/index/news/common/static/css/m.css">
    
    <script charset="UTF-8" id="LA_COLLECT" src="//sdk.51.la/js-sdk-pro.min.js"></script>
<script>LA.init({id:"L80XLERTonR0h86J",ck:"L80XLERTonR0h86J"})</script>    
    <style>
        :root {
            --theme-color: #000000;
            --theme-theme: #133ab3;
            --theme-background: #fafafa;
            --theme-other_background: #ffffff;
        }
            </style>
    <meta name="referrer" content="never">
    <style>
        /* 首页 logo/标题/副标题 紧凑化（只作用于 .homeBox 内，不影响顶部 header） */
        .homeBox.searchBox .logoBox {
            margin-top: 0;
            margin-bottom: 0;
        }
        .homeBox.searchBox .logoBox .title {
            margin: 0 6px;
        }
        .homeBox.searchBox .subTitle {
            padding: 4px 0 2px;
            margin: 0;
        }

        /* 新增样式：搜索按钮组 */
        .search-buttons-group {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 12px;
            margin: 6px auto 10px;
            flex-wrap: nowrap;
            width: 90%;
            max-width: 600px;
        }
        
        .search-action-btn {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 6px;
            padding: 8px 14px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            font-size: 19px;
            font-weight: 700;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            text-decoration: none;
            border: 2px solid transparent;
            white-space: nowrap;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12);
            flex: 1;
            min-width: 120px;
            height: 40px;
        }
        
        .search-movie-btn {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ff6b6b, #ff8e53);
            color: white;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 25px rgba(255, 107, 107, 0.3);
        }
        
        .search-movie-btn:hover {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ff5252, #ff7b39);
            transform: translateY(-4px);
            box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(255, 107, 107, 0.4);
        }
        
        .search-novel-btn {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #4dabf7, #339af0);
            color: white;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 25px rgba(51, 154, 240, 0.3);
        }
        
        .search-novel-btn:hover {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #339af0, #228be6);
            transform: translateY(-4px);
            box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(51, 154, 240, 0.4);
        }
        
        .search-buttons-group i {
            font-size: 18px;
        }
        
        /* 响应式调整 */
        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .search-buttons-group {
                gap: 10px;
                margin: 5px auto 8px;
                flex-wrap: nowrap;
                width: 95%;
                max-width: 500px;
            }
            
            .search-action-btn {
                padding: 7px 12px;
                font-size: 20px;
                flex: 1;
                min-width: 110px;
                height: 36px;
                border-radius: 10px;
            }
            
            .search-buttons-group i {
                font-size: 16px;
            }
        }
        
        @media (max-width: 480px) {
            .search-buttons-group {
                gap: 8px;
                width: 95%;
                max-width: 400px;
            }
            
            .search-action-btn {
                padding: 6px 10px;
                font-size: 18px;
                flex: 1;
                min-width: 100px;
                height: 32px;
                border-radius: 8px;
            }
            
            .search-buttons-group i {
                font-size: 14px;
            }
        }
        
        /* 搜索框样式 */
        .search {
            position: relative;
            width: 90%;
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 10px auto;
            height: 52px;
            border-radius: 26px;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95);
            box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
            overflow: hidden;
            border: 2px solid #e0e0e0;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
        }
        
        .search:hover {
            box-shadow: 0 8px 25px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);
            border-color: #ff6b6b;
        }
        
        .search input {
            flex: 1;
            height: 100%;
            padding: 0 24px;
            border: none;
            outline: none;
            font-size: 16px;
            color: #333;
            background: transparent;
        }
        
        .search input::placeholder {
            color: #999;
            font-size: 15px;
        }
        
        .search .btn {
            width: 60px;
            height: 100%;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ff6b6b, #ff8e53);
            color: white;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }
        
        .search .btn i {
            font-size: 20px;
        }
        
        /* 搜索类型提示 */
        .search-type-hint {
            text-align: center;
            color: #ff6b6b;
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-top: 2px;
            margin-bottom: 4px;
            padding: 3px 10px;
            background: rgba(255, 107, 107, 0.1);
            border-radius: 14px;
            display: inline-block;
            transform: translateY(0);
            animation: pulse 2s infinite;
        }
        
        @keyframes pulse {
            0% { transform: scale(1); }
            50% { transform: scale(1.05); }
            100% { transform: scale(1); }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <!-- 微信/QQ浏览器防红提示 -->
    <div id="wechat-redirect-modal" class="wechat-redirect-modal" style="display: none;">
        <div class="redirect-modal-content">
            <div class="redirect-modal-icon">
                <i class="iconfont icon-jinggao"></i>
            </div>
            <div class="redirect-modal-title">温馨提示</div>
            <div class="redirect-modal-text">
                由于微信/QQ限制，网页可能无法正常访问
                <br>
                请复制下方链接，然后在手机浏览器中打开
            </div>
            <div class="redirect-link-container">
                <input type="text" readonly id="redirect-link" value="https://xusou.cn/" class="redirect-link-input">
                <button class="redirect-copy-btn" onclick="copyRedirectLink()">复制链接</button>
            </div>
            <div class="redirect-steps">
                <div class="redirect-step">
                    <span class="step-number">1</span>
                    <span class="step-text">点击上方"复制链接"按钮</span>
                </div>
                <div class="redirect-step">
                    <span class="step-number">2</span>
                    <span class="step-text">打开手机浏览器（如Safari、Chrome、夸克、百度浏览器等等）</span>
                </div>
                <div class="redirect-step">
                    <span class="step-number">3</span>
                    <span class="step-text">粘贴链接并访问</span>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="redirect-browser-tips">
                <i class="iconfont icon-tips"></i>
                推荐使用系统自带浏览器访问，体验更佳
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 弹窗通知 -->
    <div id="welcome-modal" class="welcome-modal" style="display: none;">
        <div class="modal-content">
            <div class="modal-close" onclick="closeWelcomeModal()">×</div>
            <div class="modal-img-container">
                <div class="modal-title">防失联微信群</div>
                <!-- 修改这里：图片宽度从70%改为85% -->
                <img src="https://junso.top/uploads/image/20260210/a6a9d5f5eae9b9f6372e3897b6323cf6.jpg" alt="欢迎使用" class="modal-img" style="width: 85%;">
            </div>
            <button class="modal-btn" onclick="closeWelcomeModal()">我已看完，开始使用</button>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="headBg" style="background-image: url();"></div>
    <div id="app" v-cloak>
        <div class="headerBox">
    <div class="bg" :style="{ opacity: elementOpacity }" ></div>
    <div class="box">
        <a href="/" class="logoBox" :style="{ opacity: elementOpacity }" >
                        <div class="title">许搜 - 全网影视资源</div>
                    </a>
        <div class="search" :style="{ opacity: elementOpacity }" >
            <input type="text" v-model="keyword" placeholder="输入关键字进行搜索" @keyup.enter="searchBtn" confirm-type="search"
                @confirm="searchBtn">
            <div class="btn" @click="searchBtn">
                <i class="iconfont icon-sousuo"></i>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="navs">
                        <div class="item" @click="layerVisible = true">提交需求</div>
                        <div class="btns" v-html="`&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.kdocs.cn/l/cadPtljpSEPk&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;加入群聊&lt;/a&gt;`"></div>

            <div class="iconfont icon-caidan" @click="drawer = true"></div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
<div class="headerKox"></div>


<el-dialog v-model="qcodeVisible" width="300">
    <img src="" style="width: 100%" />
</el-dialog>

<el-dialog v-model="layerVisible" width="300">
    <div class="layerBox">
        <div class="vname">提交需求</div>
        <el-input v-model="content" placeholder="请输入你想看的资源信息~" type="textarea" resize='none'></el-input>
        <div class="vbtn" @click="saveBtn">提交</div>
    </div>
</el-dialog>

<el-dialog v-model="drawer" width="300" center>
    <div class="drawer">
                <div class="item" @click="layerVisible = true">提交需求</div>
                <div class="btns" v-html="`&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.kdocs.cn/l/cadPtljpSEPk&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;加入群聊&lt;/a&gt;`"></div>
    </div>
</el-dialog>

<el-dialog title="" v-model="dialogUrl" class="dialogUrlBox" :close-on-click-modal="false">
    <div v-loading="dialogLoading" class="dialogUrl" v-if="dialogUrl">
        <!-- 本地资源直接显示 -->
        <div v-if="dialogItem.is_local">
            <div class="title" style="color: #67C23A;"><span>本地资源</span> - 直接访问</div>
            <div class="tips" style="color: #67C23A;">本站提供的资源，无需转存，直接访问</div>
            <div class="nav" style="margin-top: 20px;">
                <div class="item">
                    <span class="t">{{dialogItem.title}}</span>
                </div>
                <div v-if="dialogItem.extract_code" class="item" style="color: #FF3F3D; font-weight: bold;">
                    <span>提取码：</span>
                    <span>{{dialogItem.extract_code}}</span>
                </div>
                <div class="item" v-show="pc_type!=2">
                    <span>资源地址：</span>
                    <a :href="dialogItem.showUrl" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="color: #67C23A; font-weight: bold;">{{dialogItem.showUrl}}</a>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div v-show="pc_type!=1" style="margin-top: 20px; text-align: center;">
                <div style="font-size: 14px; color: #666; margin-bottom: 10px;">扫码直接访问</div>
                <div class="qrcode" id="qrcode"></div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <!-- API资源需要转存 -->
        <div v-else-if="dialogItem.showUrl">
            <block v-show="pc_type!=1">
                <block v-if="dialogItem.is_type==0">
                    <div class="title">请使用 <span>夸克APP</span> 扫码获取</div>
                    <div class="tips">打开夸克APP- 点击搜索框中的相机 - 点击扫码</div>
                </block>
                <block v-else-if="dialogItem.is_type==3">
                    <div class="title">请使用 <span>UC浏览器</span> 扫码获取</div>
                    <div class="tips">打开UC浏览器- 点击搜索框中的相机 - 点击扫码</div>
                </block>
                <block v-else>
                    <div class="title">请使用 <span>手机扫码</span> 获取</div>
                    <div class="tips">打开微信APP- 点击右上角 - 选择扫一扫</div>
                </block>
                <div class="qrcode" id="qrcode"></div>
            </block>
            <div class="nav">
                <div class="item">
                    <span class="t">{{dialogItem.title}}</span>
                </div>
                <div class="item" v-show="pc_type!=2">
                    <span>资源地址：</span>
                    <a :href="dialogItem.showUrl" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{{dialogItem.showUrl}}</a>
                </div>
                <div class="item" v-show="pc_type!=2" style="margin-top: 10px;">
                    <a :href="dialogItem.showUrl" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="margin-right: 10px; padding: 5px 10px; background-color: #409EFF; color: white; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 4px;">打开链接</a>
                    <a href="javascript:;" @click="copyLink(dialogItem.showUrl)" style="padding: 5px 10px; background-color: #67C23A; color: white; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 4px;">复制链接</a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <!-- 失效资源：跳转引导（仅首页最新列表来源） -->
        <div v-else-if="dialogItem.is_invalid && dialogItem.fromNewList">
            <div class="title" style="color: #FF3F3D;"><span>资源可能已失效</span></div>
            <div class="tips" style="color: #FF3F3D; line-height: 1.6;">该资源可能已失效，建议前往全网搜索获取更多可用资源。</div>
            <div style="margin-top: 18px; text-align: center;">
                <a :href="goAllSearchHref(dialogItem)" style="display: inline-block; padding: 10px 28px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ff6b6b, #c84ad8); color: #fff; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 999px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(200,74,216,.25); transition: transform .15s, box-shadow .15s;">前往全网搜索</a>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div v-else-if="!dialogLoading">
            <div class="title">获取失败</div>
            <div class="tips" style="color: #FF3F3D;">{{dialogItem.message}}</div>
        </div>
<div class="statement" v-if="!dialogItem.is_local">
    <div class="content" style="color: #FF3F3D; font-weight: bold; line-height: 1.3; margin: 0;">
        注：如果百度网盘链接打开提示提取码错误，请直接复制链接打开百度网盘提取即可。默认提取码6666<br />
<br />
注：夸克网盘无文件、缺集就是被和谐了，换其他网盘<br />
注：试看2分钟是因为没转存到网盘        <hr>
                <div style="color: darkred; margin-bottom: 15px;">
            进 群：<a href="https://www.kdocs.cn/l/cadPtljpSEPk" target="_blank" style="color: darkred; border: 2px solid darkred; padding: 8px 12px; border-radius: 6px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold; display: inline-block; background-color: rgba(139, 0, 0, 0.1); transition: all 0.3s;">点我进群【防失联】</a>
        </div>
                <div style="color: darkred;">
            教 程：<a href="https://junso.top/views/index/news/common/jc.mp4" target="_blank" style="color: darkred; border: 2px solid darkred; padding: 8px 12px; border-radius: 6px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold; display: inline-block; background-color: rgba(139, 0, 0, 0.1); transition: all 0.3s;">点我看教程 ~ 使用超简单！</a>
        </div>
            </div>
</div>
    </div>
</el-dialog>
